WEBVTT

00:07:58.272 --> 00:08:02.763
Kwa hiyo ni jinsi gani tunatafuta namna

00:08:02.763 --> 00:08:04.821
katika kuendelea na kukuza hili?

00:08:04.821 --> 00:08:07.917
Jinsi gani kila mmoja wetu atatafuta njia

00:08:07.917 --> 00:08:09.851
ya kuishi kwa shukrani,

00:08:09.851 --> 00:08:11.668
sio mara moja tu kuwa na shukrani,

00:08:11.668 --> 00:08:14.212
lakini wakati hadi wakati.

00:08:14.212 --> 00:08:15.637
Tunaweza kufanyaje?

00:08:15.637 --> 00:08:17.967
Ni rahisi sana.

00:08:17.967 --> 00:08:22.354
Ni rahisi sana,kama tulivyoambiwa wakati

00:08:22.354 --> 00:08:25.882
tukiwa watoto tulijifunza kukatiza mitaani.

00:08:25.882 --> 00:08:29.471
Simama.Angalia.Nenda.

00:08:29.471 --> 00:08:30.986
Hivyo tu.